    · change (p 2*rowLogD u p 1)^2≤1
      nlinarith [sq_nonneg (p 2*rowLogD u p 0),sq_nonneg (p 2*rowLogD u p 2)]
    · change (p 2*rowLogD u p 2)^2≤1
