    (∫z in periodDomain,cubeAverage p hp F (upperPoint z v hv)*ShortDraftTrace.breveE (-cuspFrequency h*z))=
      ∫z in periodDomain,F (upperPoint z (v/‖eisEmbedding p‖^3)
