      (∫z in periodDomain,term r z)=∫z in periodDomain,f z*ShortDraftTrace.breveE (-cuspFrequency (h*p^3)*z):=
    period_fourier_fractional_translation f hfperiod (p^3) (pow_ne_zero 3 hp) h _
