    (by positivity) (fun r=>cubeReducedRemainder_bound_from_height (d r) hp.ne_zero a K ha hK hrep z v hv hav)
  have hrest:‖(Ideal.absNorm (Ideal.span {p}):ℂ)⁻¹*sourceCuspRemainder M z v hv‖≤
