      um am bm g hg hm u a b r hr hx hbad hcop hA hT (Sum.inl P)
  | inr P=>
    exact goodMaskFreePrimeFiberEquiv_exponent R I F Q0 hR hI hF m f z hm0 hf hz
      um am bm g hg hm u a b r hr hx hbad hcop hA hT (Sum.inr P.val)

